{"id":"8086f2be7f666ab6","group":"92","path":"92/92-ex-consistency-hierarchy-examples.md","title":"Consistency Hierarchy Examples","display":"ex-consistency-hierarchy-examples — Consistency Hierarchy Examples","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","display":"ex-consistency-hierarchy-examples — Consistency Hierarchy Examples","label":"92-ex-consistency-hierarchy-examples","aliases":["92-ex-consistency-hierarchy-examples"],"depends_on":["[[92-df-consistency-hierarchy]]","[[92-df-sound-system]]","[[92-df-omega-consistency]]","[[92-df-1-consistency]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[92-df-theory-set]]"],"source":"第 V 章 pp. 60–63（PDF 77–80）；Σ1 可靠性比较为本地补充","source_status":"原书相容性主题的本地补充"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-consistency-hierarchy-examples — Consistency Hierarchy Examples"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ex-consistency-hierarchy-examples"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ex-consistency-hierarchy-examples</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28f4d899d4e85281\" href=\"?note=28f4d899d4e85281\" title=\"92-df-consistency-hierarchy\">92-df-consistency-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6fc24b4011f16912\" href=\"?note=6fc24b4011f16912\" title=\"92-df-1-consistency\">92-df-1-consistency</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"468d35690d25ee42\" href=\"?note=468d35690d25ee42\" title=\"92-df-robinson-arithmetic\">92-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 60–63（PDF 77–80）；Σ1 可靠性比较为本地补充"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相容性主题的本地补充"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (system G)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\)</span> (arithmetical soundness of the formal system, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d76d3a84b374975c\" href=\"?note=d76d3a84b374975c\" title=\"92-df-sound-system\">92-df-sound-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> (consistency predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6fc24b4011f16912\" href=\"?note=6fc24b4011f16912\" title=\"92-df-1-consistency\">92-df-1-consistency</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> (basic arithmetic strength)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}examples}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\bigr)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}examples}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\bigr)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一致性层级示例；三个箭头都是元语言蕴含，故不使用对象语言<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span></li>\n<li>对满足第二不完备性定理假设且外部一致的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G+\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(G+\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>仍可一致；否则演绎定理会给出<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>实际上可靠，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span>是假的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>句，所以该扩展不具<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>一致性；这说明元语言蕴含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span>一般不可逆</li>\n<li>在含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>、能逐个验证真有界实例的通常算术系统中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性蕴含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>一致性，故在该范围内不存在“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致但不<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>一致”的反例</li>\n<li>其余箭头是否严格以及严格性的见证取决于语言、基理论和外部可靠性假设，不能由本行蕴含式自动推出</li>\n</ul>\n<p>算术强度核对：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\)</span> 表示每条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 公理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" href=\"?note=0a1ba58f66cc8d4e\" title=\"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q\">92-lem-local-pa-proves-q</a>；若继续要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\">\\(Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)\\)</span>，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>可靠性、ω 相容性、Σ1 可靠性与普通相容性按各自定义比较。扩张 G+¬Con_G 的相容见证还用第二不完备性，不能只由基本箭头得出；这个扩张属于本地说明而非原书原句。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 60–63（PDF 77–80）；Σ1 可靠性比较为本地补充。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-consistency-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"28f4d899d4e85281","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sound-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-1-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"6fc24b4011f16912","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"468d35690d25ee42","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sound-system","status":"resolved","id":"d76d3a84b374975c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}(G)$ (arithmetical soundness of the formal system, see [[92-df-sound-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Con}$ (consistency predicates, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]], [[92-df-1-consistency]], [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-1-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"6fc24b4011f16912","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Con}$ (consistency predicates, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]], [[92-df-1-consistency]], [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Con}$ (consistency predicates, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]], [[92-df-1-consistency]], [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-local-pa-proves-q","status":"resolved","id":"0a1ba58f66cc8d4e","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"算术强度核对：$Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)$ 表示每条 $Q$ 公理在 $G$ 中可证，不要求是原始公理。当前 P.A. 采用六条基本公理加归纳，后继前身公理由归纳导出，见[[92-lem-local-pa-proves-q]]；若继续要求 $Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)$，就无法把本条应用于当前固定 $G$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}examples}\\vdash\nQ\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Sound}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\bigr)\n\\land\n\\bigl(1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\bigr)\n\\right]","display":true},{"tex":"\\to","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G+\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Th}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ax}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":2875,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-377","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"exce